CTUALLY PLAY, THERE SHOULD BE AN IQ ENTRANCE TEST BEFORE EACH GAME. WHEN I QUE I GET VENEZUELIAN FAVELA CIA NECKERS, COMPUTER BIOWASTE OR ELON MUSK. PLEASE BLOW UP YOUR COMPUTER AND GO FINGER YOUR PROSTATE MUSCLES, PLEASE", "timestamp_created": 1753998966, "timestamp_updated": 1773757909, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.459363967180252075", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "201170632", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999479425", "personaname": "Anmheda", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/anmheda/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 254, "last_played": 1755445601, "avatar": "8000e98136ebd2df118c962a42d4e5199c4c551d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I rly loved the first Elden Ring, but this is bad. \n\nFirst of all, the price tag for this is just wrong. It should have been a DLC for Elden Ring, not a game of its own with that price tag, for what it is. Enemies are the same, bosses the same, weapons the same, most changes are the game system (roguelike battle royale arena), which sucks rly hard atm. Other than that, the game feels mostly the same. Dont buy this unless 50% sale, is what I recommend. And if you buy it, look for mods to make the gameplay better.\n\nSecondly, the storm timer is so ♥♥♥♥♥♥, how the hell did the devs/publisher think this would make the game fun/good? Like stressing out players giving them no time to explore.... \nAt least they could have given players a little bit more time to explore in the first damn world. What made Elden Ring good? The exploration and progression of your hero! What makes Nightrein good? Well not much, Imo. You have so little time before that stupid storm arrives, so there is no time for exploration, no time to read about new gear (unless you played for a while and gotten used to the new things), and you have no progression at all after you die, except for small little runes you can put on yourself before you set out for the next \"exploration\".\nYou cant even level up your heroes customising dex, str, vigor and stuff, its all pre-set. You just run into the grace and click \"level up\", and it level up all your stats for the hero you pick... Boring.\n\nThird, if you die too much, you lose progress and even your current level goes down. What a mess. They couldnt avoid making this game annoying with the short timer every time you play, but they had to punish the players even more taking away progression if you die too much from stupid things like the storm popping up in your face while doing a boss fight! Great! And they dont even add an option for a mini map so you can easily see when the storm is close, you have to open the big map all the time to check. No QoL stuff whatsoever... \n\nI will keep playing this ♥♥♥♥♥♥ game, but not the original, I will use mods that make that stupid storm timer slower, so I can explore and have fun. Im pretty sure many mods will make this game great, like it should have been from the start! I wouldnt hate the game if the timer was a little bit slower, giving you more time, especially in the first world.\n\nBuy on sale only. Use mods. That is my recommendation.", "timestamp_created": 1753998944, "timestamp_updated": 1754022084, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.456431567668914795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": 